  T("day", "My workation day", "Overlap, focus, then see the place", "🌅", [TXT("where", "Destination", "Lisbon", True), CH("style", "Work style", ["Front-load early", "Split shift", "Late shift"], "Split shift")],
    "Design a typical working day in {where} with a '{style}' pattern for the profile role and team zones. Produce a table (Local time | Team time | Activity | Type: overlap / focus / life) from wake to sleep, bullets on where to work from (apartment, coworking, café) by task type, a callout on the trap of doing one and a half jobs, and a quote with the away-message or calendar note that tells colleagues when you're reachable.", "table, bullets, callout, quote", "Plan my day", "Sun and Slack…"),
